KuberNow - Delete Your Account and Data
App: KuberNow: My Money Journey
Developer: KuberNow
Last updated: November 22, 2026

You can ask us to delete your KuberNow account and the data linked to it at any time. You do not need to keep the app installed to make a request.

How to request account deletion
1. Send an email to Amit@AmericaMaGujarati.com from the email address you use to sign in to KuberNow.
2. Use the subject line: Delete my KuberNow account
3. In the message, include the email address or sign-in method (for example, Google Sign-In) on your account. Do not send passwords or financial account numbers.
4. We will confirm we received your request within 7 days and may ask you to confirm it so we know the request came from you.
5. We will delete your account and data within 30 days of confirming your request, and email you when it is done.

Deleting only some of your data
If you want to keep your account but delete specific data (for example, your financial estimates, goals, learning history, or AI question history), email us with the subject line "Delete my KuberNow data" and tell us what to delete. We will do this within 30 days.

What we delete
- Your account and profile: name, email address, sign-in identifier, and preferences.
- Financial estimates you entered: income, expenses, savings, assets, debts, goals, and calculator inputs.
- Learning progress, quiz answers, saved tasks, and reminders.
- AI feature questions and responses linked to your account.
- Push-notification tokens and app identifiers linked to your account.

What we keep, and for how long
- Purchase and subscription records: kept as long as required for tax, accounting, and legal purposes (generally up to 7 years). Most of these are held by Google Play or Amazon.
- Support emails, including your deletion request: kept up to 24 months so we can show we handled your request, then deleted.
- Encrypted backups: deleted data may remain in backups for up to 90 days until they are overwritten.
- Aggregated or de-identified analytics that cannot identify you may be kept. Identifiable analytics data expires within 14 months and crash data within 90 days.

Subscriptions
Deleting your account or uninstalling the app does not cancel a paid subscription. Cancel it first in Google Play (Play Store > Profile > Payments & subscriptions > Subscriptions) or the Amazon Appstore (Your Memberships and Subscriptions).

